#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "ក្តារ​ចុច"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "This module allows you to choose how your keyboard works."
msgstr "ម៉ូឌុល​នេះ​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​ជ្រើស​របៀប​ធ្វើការ​របស់​ក្ដារ​ចុច​របស់​អ្នក ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The actual effect of setting these options depends upon the features provided "
"by your keyboard hardware and the X server on which &kde; is running. As an "
"example, you may find that changing the key click volume has no effect because "
"that feature is not available on your system."
msgstr "បែប​ផែន​ពិត​ប្រាកដ​នៃ​ការ​កំណត់​ជម្រើស​ទាំង​នេះ​គឺ​ពឹង​ផ្អែក​លើ​លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​ដែល​បាន​ផ្ដល់​ដោយ​ក្ដារ​ចុច​របស់​អ្នក និង​ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ X ​នៅលើ​ KDE ណា​ដែល​កំពុង​រត់ ។ ឧទាហរណ៍ អ្នក​អាច​ស្វែង​​យល់​ឃើញ​ថា ការ​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​​កម្រិត​ចុច​គ្រាប់​ចុច​គ្មាន​ឥទ្ធិ​ពល​ទេ ព្រោះ​លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​នោះ​មិនមាន​នៅលើ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​របស់​អ្នក​ទេ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "កម្រិត​ខ្ពស់"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable keyboard repeat"
msgstr "អាច​ឲ្យ​ក្ដារ​ចុច​ធ្វើ​ឡើង"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, pressing and holding down a key emits the same "
"character repeatedly until the key is released. Pressing and holding the key "
"will have the same effect as pressing it multiple times in succession."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Almost all users will want to have this option enabled, because it makes "
"navigating through documents with the arrow keys significantly easier."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "NumLock on KDE Startup"
msgstr "NumLock នៅ​ពេល​ចាប់​ផ្ដើម KDE"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose to either always <guilabel>Turn on</guilabel> or <guilabel>"
"Turn off</guilabel> the NumLock when &kde; starts, or you can choose to have "
"&kde; leave NumLock at whatever it was set to before KDE started up."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Key click volume:"
msgstr "សម្លេង​ចុច​គ្រាប់​ចុច ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If supported, this option allows you to hear audible clicks from your "
"computer's speakers when you press the keys on your keyboard. In essence, this "
"simulates the <quote>click</quote> of a mechanical type-writer. You can change "
"the loudness of the key click feedback by dragging the slider button or by "
"clicking the up/down arrows on the spin-button. Setting the volume to 0% turns "
"off the key click."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Many computers won't support this function."
msgstr "កុំព្យូទ័រ​ជា​ច្រើន​មិន​គាំទ្រ​មុខងារ​នេះ​ទេ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Very few people would choose to enable this option, since it generally annoys "
"everyone else in the room. However, if your heart yearns for the pre-soft-key "
"era, this may help you to re-experience the warm sentimentality of "
"days-gone-by."
msgstr ""

